{
 "version": 1,
 "meta": {
  "title": "fig-front-end",
  "description": "Front end as simulated: a 6-tap shunt ladder from I+ to I minus; each tap switch with its UCC27524 driver referenced to I+ and 22 ohm gate resistor; group H behind the isolation FET Qi, whose gate is tied to the follower U7 by Qb while off; group M straight on I minus; and the stage-1 amplifiers on sense taps 3, 5 and 6 (OPA210, OPA210, OPA387)."
 },
